<title>UK: London U.S. stock trading halts for Thanksgiving.</title>
<headline>London U.S. stock trading halts for Thanksgiving.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dealers said there was no trading in U.S. stocks in London on Thursday because of the national Thanksgiving holiday in the U.S.</p>
<p>Wall Street is closed on Thursday for the holiday but will re-open on Friday for an abbreviated session ending at 1800 GMT. Overnight, the Dow Jones Industrial Average closed 0.45 percent lower at 6,499.34 points.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
